X: 1
T: Les filles des forges de Paimpont
O: Traditional Breton, Pays Gallo
N: A round from the Broceliande forest, about the girls who worked the
N: ironworks at Paimpont. Melody from Adolphe Orain, "Chansons de la
N: Haute-Bretagne" (1902), p. 36, via Eric Forgeot's transcription;
N: transposed up a fifth for recorder range. Orain's final note is a quarter;
N: it is an eighth here so the 1/8 pickup is paid back and the tune loops.
L: 1/8
Q: 1/4=110
M: 2/4
K: Am
